sequenceDiagram
    participant CSMS
    participant OCPP as OCPP module
    participant Module as Evse15118D20
    participant Ctrl as TbdController
    participant Session as running Session
    participant EV

    CSMS->>OCPP: SetDERControl
    OCPP->>Module: grid_support set_active_directives
    Module->>Module: apply_active_der_directives
    opt AC_DER_SAE not advertised or its limits not derived yet
        Note over Module: info log, revision untouched, stop here
    end
    Module->>Module: relay_sae_grid_code
    Module->>Module: sae_relay_input<br/>sorted (id, received_at) plus nominal voltage and frequency
    alt relay input unchanged
        Note over Module: revision stays in effect, nothing pushed
    else relay input changed
        Module->>Module: map_active_directives_to_sae_der_control<br/>default grid code plus winners per Annex M element,<br/>trip curves transposed to duration-first
        Module->>Module: validate_sae_der_setup against SAE DER limits and AC limits
        alt violation
            Note over Module: warning, previous revision remains dictated
        else valid
            Module->>Module: revision + 1, store as next-session setup
            Module->>Ctrl: update_der_sae_limits(limits, setup config)
            Ctrl->>Session: push_control_event(DerSaeSetupConfig)
            Session->>Session: install_der_sae_setup_config<br/>validate_sae_der_setup against the session's own limits
            alt violation
                Note over Session: warning, the running session keeps its old grid code,<br/>the new revision is still the next-session setup
            else installed
                EV->>Session: DER_SAE_AC_ChargeLoopReq
                Session-->>EV: DERControlCLRes: EnterServiceCLRes plus voltage_trip,<br/>frequency_trip, reactive_power_support_cl_res,<br/>active_power_support_cl_res
                Session->>Session: record_der_control_sent(revision),<br/>EnabledModes warning re-armed
            end
        end
    end
